@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Create all Supabase tables (safe to re-run — uses IF NOT EXISTS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/setup-db

###

### Check evaluation status
GET {{baseUrl}}/status

###

### Start judging — replace with your public Google Sheets URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/judge
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sheet_url": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1jqx2C8IOz2UFSN02yKBSkjS8zGs3-eNnvoxLoFZyba4/edit?usp=sharing"
}

###

### Get all results from Supabase
GET {{baseUrl}}/results

###

### Download all results as CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/download-csv
